[parameters: {'id__0': '752cbed5-68cb-483e-9638-c2e2ee5e8653', 'language__0': 'Hindi', 'text_id__0': 'e289350d-dd17-4ffe-81a2-affec69f8860', 'commentary__0': None, 'translation__0': 'इसी तरह करते हुए बिनोद बहुत प्रात प्रकट होते हैं। सौम्य और निर्भय लंकापति सभा में जाते हैं, मद और अंधकार में डूबे हुए।', 'generated_by__0': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'id__1': '5651f085-5adc-4184-bdd8-d6256c912745', 'language__1': 'English', 'text_id__1': 'e289350d-dd17-4ffe-81a2-affec69f8860', 'commentary__1': None, 'translation__1': 'Thus, in a playful manner, many manifestations become visible at dawn. The gentle and fearless Ravana goes to the assembly, overcome by pride and ignorance.', 'generated_by__1': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'id__2': '3f4138bf-52ff-4a0c-9402-aa7917bdd061', 'language__2': 'Hindi', 'text_id__2': '16(क)', 'commentary__2': None, 'translation__2': 'फूलों के समान ही वह जलद है, जो सुधा बरसाता है। मूर्ख हृदय में यह नहीं जागता कि गुरु मिलने पर ब्रह्मा के समान हो जाते हैं।', 'generated_by__2': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'id__3': '7d6a8ad4-d963-4dae-972a-689678e6ee0f', 'language__3': 'English', 'text_id__3': '16(क)', 'commentary__3': None, 'translation__3': 'Like flowers, the lightning (jald) showers nectar. A foolish heart does not realize that by meeting the guru, one becomes like Brahma.', 'generated_by__3': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'id__4': 'c0facdbf-4adc-45b3-9781-f2e15642f2a7', 'language__4': 'Hindi', 'text_id__4': 'e289350d-dd17-4ffe-81a2-affec69f8860', 'commentary__4': None, 'translation__4': 'गूढ़ कपट प्रिय बचन सुनकर तीन अधरबुधि रानियाँ हो गईं। सुरमया ने अपने पतियों के साथ बैर-निहित सुहद जानकर।', 'generated_by__4': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'id__5': '2b566a18-b992-4add-aeaf-91df33f7eb66', 'language__5': 'English', 'text_id__5': 'e289350d-dd17-4ffe-81a2-affec69f8860', 'commentary__5': None, 'translation__5': 'Upon hearing the cryptic and deceitful words, the three foolish queens became enraged. Surmayā realized that her friends were actually her enemies.', 'generated_by__5': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'id__6': 'd12b3543-a239-42b4-824f-48f9dd2fe17a', 'language__6': 'Hindi', 'text_id__6': '3fc69e6f-c366-4ce2-b49f-d58d9d265cde', 'commentary__6': None, 'translation__6': 'इहाँ प्रात जागे रघुराज। पूछा मत सब सचिव बोलाई। कहहु बेगि का करिअ उपाई। जामवंत कह पद सिरु नाई।', 'generated_by__6': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'id__7': '831433d6-f5c2-4c53-95e5-b105df7be365', 'language__7': 'English', 'text_id__7': '3fc69e6f-c366-4ce2-b49f-d58d9d265cde', 'commentary__7': None, 'translation__7': "Here, Raghurāj woke up at dawn. He asked his secretary, who replied, 'Tell me, what is to be done?' Jamvant said, 'I will go and find out.'", 'generated_by__7': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'id__8': '8786b81f-5c35-4f9c-a04f-5629c86fb2f8', 'language__8': 'Hindi' ... 8 parameters truncated ... 'translation__9': 'Listen, O all-knowing one, to the words of my heart. I speak according to my own mind. I send a messenger, a young girl, to convey my message.', 'generated_by__9': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'id__10': '82404b2d-615d-441f-b0a6-080b93527b1d', 'language__10': 'Hindi', 'text_id__10': '91242e32-4aa4-48d0-8109-59bcc2b04947', 'commentary__10': None, 'translation__10': 'नीक मंत्र सब के मन माना। अंगद सन कह कृपानिधाना। बालितनय बुधि बल गुन धामा। लंका जाहु तात मम कामा।', 'generated_by__10': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'id__11': '5243dd50-3ec6-434f-a34a-eeec29516116', 'language__11': 'English', 'text_id__11': '91242e32-4aa4-48d0-8109-59bcc2b04947', 'commentary__11': None, 'translation__11': "The good message is accepted by everyone's heart. Angad said, 'O Kṛpānidhān, tell me.' The young girl, with her wisdom, strength, and virtues, goes to Lanka to fulfill my task.", 'generated_by__11': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'id__12': 'dddf12b2-739e-4737-a737-567fafb8ce42', 'language__12': 'Hindi', 'text_id__12': '91242e32-4aa4-48d0-8109-59bcc2b04947', 'commentary__12': None, 'translation__12': 'बहुत बुझाइ तुम्हहि का कहऊँ। परम चतुर मैं जानत अहऊँ। काजु हमार तासु हित होई। रिपु सन करेहु बतकही सोई।', 'generated_by__12': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'id__13': '28a8a5a1-5ce3-45c8-b6c2-fa092871e747', 'language__13': 'English', 'text_id__13': '91242e32-4aa4-48d0-8109-59bcc2b04947', 'commentary__13': None, 'translation__13': 'I have explained it to you thoroughly. I am very wise and know what to do. Our task will be beneficial for both of us. Do as I say, and defeat the enemy.', 'generated_by__13': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'id__14': '3ff5d857-8297-48f6-b8a4-04a00f15ba0b', 'language__14': 'Hindi', 'text_id__14': '5a185a30-c05a-4421-953a-da7d327807b3', 'commentary__14': None, 'translation__14': 'बंदउँ अवध भुआल सत्य प्रेम जेहि राम पद। बिछुरत दीनदयाल प्रिय तनु तृन इव परिहरेउ।', 'generated_by__14': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'id__15': 'e8e79a6c-b808-4c25-a9d9-abfaa6647a2a', 'language__15': 'English', 'text_id__15': '5a185a30-c05a-4421-953a-da7d327807b3', 'commentary__15': None, 'translation__15': 'I surrender to the lotus feet of Rām, the embodiment of true love and compassion. Like dry leaves, I am discarded by the kind-hearted Rām.', 'generated_by__15': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'id__16': '477776e6-740c-4cee-921b-9f37b970a815', 'language__16': 'Hindi', 'text_id2026-04-12 12:57:07,810 WARNING    ❌ Batch 57 failed (no response)
